        alt="The ZeroStick EXO card with the version pill on the right.">
      <figcaption>Figure GET-SUPP.2 — Global Settings › General: your EXO's version</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="m2-sec" id="p-help-get-support--check">
